# MIDAS local operator bundle. Copy values only into ignored .env.supabase.local.
# Never paste values into docs/logs or expose privileged keys to public clients.
# Existing Credential Manager/CLI authentication remains separate.
# Legacy service-role is retained only for authorized rollback, not new callers.
